[38;5;252m[1m## What the project turned out to be[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mCargo.toml[0m declares [1mno [38;5;10m[features][0m[22m and [38;5;10mCMakeLists.txt[0m has no build options, so there is exactly one configuration: [38;5;10m--no-default-features[0m with nothing enabled. The API is a single exported function, [38;5;10mima_parse[0m, a CAF/IMA4 header parser.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;252m[1m## Test suite (37 tests, all via [38;5;10mlibloading[0m on both [38;5;10m.so[0m files)[0m[0m
[0m[0m
Built bottom-up per the C call hierarchy. Since [38;5;10mima_bswap*[0m/[38;5;10mima_btoh*[0m are [38;5;10mstatic[0m and unexported, they're driven through the fields that pass straight through them.[0m[0m
[0m[0m
- **level1_byteswap** — [38;5;10mbtoh32[0m via [38;5;10mchannel_count[0m, [38;5;10mbtoh64[0m via [38;5;10mframe_count[0m and [38;5;10minfo->size[0m, [38;5;10mbtoh16[0m via a full 65 536-value sweep of the [38;5;10mversion[0m check. Includes every single-byte lane × all 256 values, so no swap lane can be wrong.[0m[0m
- **level2_parse_flow** — [38;5;10m-1[0m/[38;5;10m-2[0m/[38;5;10m-3[0m returns (single-byte sweeps of the [38;5;10mcaff[0m and [38;5;10mima4[0m FourCCs), all chunk permutations, unknown-chunk skipping, later-chunk override, the exact [38;5;10mblocks[0m offset (+20 from chunk start), ignored fields, and unaligned input pointers (skew 0–7).[0m[0m
- **level3_sample_rate** — the highest-risk path. [38;5;10mconv64.u = desc->sample_rate[0m is a [3mnumeric[23m [38;5;10mdouble → u64[0m conversion (UB in C for NaN/negative/out-of-range), then a byte swap, then a bit reinterpretation. Covered with all 65 536 top-16-bit patterns, a full 2048-exponent sweep, a dense sweep around the 2^63 pivot, all NaN/Inf payload classes, and 70 000 random patterns. The existing [38;5;10mcvttsd2si[0m emulation matches gcc exactly.[0m[0m
- **level4_fuzz_and_symbols** — ~90 000 structured fuzz cases (including negative/oversized chunk sizes that make the walk jump backwards, pre-validated by a reference walk so both sides stay in bounds) plus an [38;5;10mnm -D[0m parity assertion.[0m[0m
